{"version":1,"content":"<p>HOY處境劇《你的保安李寶安》播映一個月以來，陸續有新角色加入，下星期網絡紅人倪安慈（阿慈）將強勢加盟臨海峯保安團隊，兼且引發保安部內「斷捨離」風波；</p><p>劇集內的感情線亦全面爆發，除了麥峰終於向心儀已久的女神劉綺婷（Yanny）展開表白大作戰外</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T15:23:53.296737+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T14:59:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T15:17:14.251634+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T15:17:14.251634+00:00","content_hash":"35d41eccbb720e7d9e7377c938b1df51573272926730a22439f76dc1a2cb4b50","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}